    "体表每个导联只记录该环在自身导联轴上的投影：投影为正，波形向上；投影为负，波形向下。向量环越“朝向”某个导联，该导联的波幅越大。": "Each surface lead only records the projection of this loop onto its own lead axis: a positive projection produces an upward waveform; a negative projection produces a downward waveform. The more the vector loop is \"oriented toward\" a given lead, the larger the amplitude in that lead.",
    "体表每个导联只记录该环在自身导联轴上的投影：投影为正，波形向上；投影为负，波形向下。向量环越“朝向”某个导联，该导联的波幅越大；图中的淡色虚线表示当前瞬时向量到所选导联轴的投影。": "Each surface lead records only the projection of the loop onto its own lead axis: a positive projection gives an upward waveform; a negative projection gives a downward waveform. The more the vector loop \"faces\" a lead, the larger the amplitude in that lead; the light dashed line in the figure shows the projection of the current instantaneous vector onto the selected lead axis.",
    "你仍可使用全部学习、练习与急救内容；登录后还可获得流式问答与错题分析。": "You can still use all learning, practice, and emergency content; after logging in, you also get streaming Q&A and wrong-answer analysis.",
