    "同一条心电图，在不同地区可能对应不同的治疗阈值。先学可迁移的判读框架，再标注指南版本与适用人群。": "The same ECG may correspond to different treatment thresholds in different regions. Learn the transferable interpretation framework first, then note the guideline version and applicable population.",
    "同一瞬时的空间向量投影到 12 个导联轴：朝向某导联为正，背离为负。V1–V6 为水平面教学近似，不是诊断图。": "The spatial vector at the same instant is projected onto the 12 lead axes: toward a lead is positive, away from it is negative. V1–V6 are horizontal-plane teaching approximations, not diagnostic tracings.",
    "同一瞬时的空间向量投影到 12 个导联轴：朝向某导联为正，背离为负。V1–V6 为水平面教学近似，不是诊断图；小振幅导联使用最小可见度增益，精确投影数值以上方读数/投影条为准。": "Spatial vector at a single instant projected onto 12 lead axes: positive toward a lead, negative away. V1–V6 are horizontal-plane teaching approximations, not diagnostic plots; low-amplitude leads use minimum visible gain, and exact projection values follow the readings/projection bars above.",
    "同分时按正确题数排序": "Ties sorted by number of correct questions",
    "同步": "Sync",
    "同步导联波形": "Synchronized lead waveforms",
    "同步模式充电": "Sync mode charging",
    "同步电复律": "Synchronized cardioversion",
    "同步：有脉搏、需电复律；非同步：无脉 VF / 无脉性 VT。充电可直接进行，不需要等待其他操作完成。": "Synchronized: has pulse, requires cardioversion; unsynchronized: pulseless VF / pulseless VT. Charging can be done directly without waiting for other actions to complete.",
    "向 AI 导师提问": "Ask the AI tutor",
    "向量方向与导联投影仅供教学参考，用于理解“投影”和“向量大小”，": "Vector direction and lead projection are for teaching reference only, used to understand \"projection\" and \"vector magnitude,\"",
    "向量环同步导联波形": "Vector loop with synchronized lead waveforms",
    "吸氧": "Oxygen",
    "呋塞米后乏力、心悸；U 波突出、QT 延长。补钾同时必须补镁，否则难纠正。": "Fatigue and palpitations after furosemide; prominent U waves, prolonged QT. Magnesium must be supplemented along with potassium, otherwise it is difficult to correct.",
    "周末也不中断": "No interruption on weekends",
    "周榜 / 总榜按分数聚合": "Weekly / overall leaderboards aggregated by score",
    "周榜取最近 7 天，总榜累计全部记录。": "Weekly leaderboard covers the last 7 days; overall leaderboard includes all records.",
    "和相似诊断怎么鉴别？": "How to differentiate from similar diagnoses?",
    "回到测试模块": "Return to test module",
    "围停搏期": "Peri-arrest period",
    "围停搏期：高钾/无脉电活动": "Peri-arrest: hyperkalemia / pulseless electrical activity",
    "围术期心脏风险与心电图": "Perioperative cardiac risk",
    "固定顺序能减少“看见一个特征就下结论”的错误。": "A fixed order can reduce the error of “jumping to conclusions upon seeing one feature.”",
    "图形为教学示意：向量方向与导联关系用于理解投影，不替代真实患者 12 导联诊断。": "The graphics are for teaching purposes: the relationship between vector direction and leads is used to understand projection and does not replace 12-lead diagnosis in a real patient.",
    "在实时监护中做决定：先高质量 CPR，再识别可除颤心律；判断是否需要电治疗并选择正确模式。药物、能量与按压中断都会被记录并复盘。": "Make decisions under real-time monitoring: high-quality CPR first, then identify shockable rhythms; determine whether electrical therapy is needed and select the correct mode. Medications, energy, and compression interruptions are recorded and reviewed.",
    "在实时监护中做决定：先高质量 CPR，再识别可除颤心律；有脉不稳定用同步，无脉用非同步。药物、能量与按压中断都会被记录并复盘。": "Make decisions during real-time monitoring: high-quality CPR first, then identify shockable rhythms; for unstable with a pulse use synchronized, for pulseless use unsynchronized. Medications, energy, and compression interruptions are all recorded and reviewed.",
