    "坚持每天 10 分钟，保持判读手感。连续完成会累计打卡天数。": "Stick to 10 minutes a day to maintain your interpretation skills. Consecutive completions accumulate check-in days.",
    "基于本设备最近的练习记录；注册账号的错题与复习间隔会同步，但这份周报暂不跨设备合并。": "Based on recent practice records on this device; wrong answers and review intervals sync for registered accounts, but this weekly report is not merged across devices.",
    "基础/进阶/挑战答对 +10/+15/+20，答错按 4× 基础分扣分，面向所有用户。榜单只展示公开昵称、正确/错误数与测试分，不展示答题内容或个人信息。": "Basic/Advanced/Challenge correct +10/+15/+20; incorrect deducts 4× the basic score; available to all users. The leaderboard shows only public nickname, correct/wrong counts, and test score; it does not show answer content or personal information.",
    "基础/进阶/挑战答对 +10/+15/+20，答错按 4× 基础分扣分；未达 Lv.5/Lv.8 的进阶/挑战为自由练习，不计分、不扣分；Lv10 后基础题不再给经验。低于 -100 分锁定至次日。 今日暂未上榜。": "Basic/Advanced/Challenge correct +10/+15/+20; incorrect deducts 4× the basic score; Advanced/Challenge below Lv.5/Lv.8 are free practice, with no scoring or deduction; after Lv10, Basic questions no longer award experience. Below -100 points is locked until the next day. Not on the leaderboard today.",
