    "本页为教学摘要，不构成诊疗建议。药物剂量、电击能量、时间窗与抗凝方案必须以当地现行指南、药品说明书和设备为准。": "This page is an educational summary and does not constitute medical advice. Drug doses, shock energies, time windows, and anticoagulation regimens must be based on current local guidelines, drug labeling, and equipment.",
    "本页心电图与内容用于医学教育，不构成诊断或治疗建议；真实患者请结合病史、体检、化验与临床指南判断。波形为教学用途的形态学近似。": "The ECGs and content on this page are for medical education and do not constitute diagnostic or treatment advice; for real patients, make judgments in conjunction with history, physical examination, laboratory tests, and clinical guidelines. Waveforms are morphological approximations for teaching purposes.",
    "本项目不提供个体化诊疗指令；药物剂量、电击能量与临床决策必须结合当地指南、设备和患者情况。": "This project does not provide individualized diagnostic or treatment instructions; drug doses, shock energies, and clinical decisions must be combined with local guidelines, equipment, and patient circumstances.",
