    "来自「心电理论（独立）」章节": "From the “ECG Theory (Standalone)” chapter",
    "来自不同教学团队的可插拔课程内容。课程包独立命名空间、独立版本与许可，经人工审阅后发布；不自动并入主课程或题库。": "Pluggable course content from different teaching teams. Course packages have independent namespaces, versions, and licenses, and are published after manual review; they are not automatically merged into the main course or question bank.",
