    "每个板块先完成 10 道随机学习题；通过 8 题记为“已学习”。至少 8 个板块已学习后解锁综合考试。评级来自最近 50 题，样本超过 10 题才显示等级。": "For each section, first complete 10 random learning questions; passing 8 marks it as “Learned”. The comprehensive exam unlocks after at least 8 sections are learned. Ratings are based on the most recent 50 questions; a grade is shown only when the sample exceeds 10 questions.",
    "每天 00:00 重新计算今日榜。": "Today's leaderboard is recalculated every day at 00:00.",
    "每天 10 道全站同题的心电图判读，连续完成累计打卡；独立计分，不占用测试分。": "10 site-wide identical ECG interpretation questions every day; complete them consecutively to accumulate check-ins; scored independently and not counted toward test scores.",
    "每天 10 道心电图判读题，全站使用同一套题；每天只能完成一次，连续完成累计打卡。作答与判分在服务端完成，不占用每日练习的测试分。": "10 ECG interpretation questions every day, using the same set for the whole site; you can complete it only once per day, and consecutive completions build your streak. Answering and scoring are handled on the server and do not use up your daily practice test score.",
    "每日挑战独立计分，不写入测试分与排行榜。": "The daily challenge is scored independently and is not included in test scores or leaderboards.",
    "每条线索都可测量": "Every clue is measurable",
    "每次修订记录版本、日期、问题与改动；公开 GitHub Issue 与本页。": "Each revision records the version, date, issue, and changes; GitHub Issues and this page are public.",
    "每次操作都会改变患者状态；按指南执行关键动作，复盘会指出按压中断、能量选择、同步模式与药物时序。": "Every intervention changes the patient's state; perform key actions according to guidelines, and the debrief will point out compression interruptions, energy selection, synchronization mode, and medication timing.",
    "每次操作都会改变患者状态；按指南执行关键动作，复盘会指出按压中断、能量选择、电治疗模式与药物时序。": "Each action changes the patient's status; perform key actions per guidelines. The debrief will point out compression interruptions, energy selection, electrical therapy mode, and medication timing.",
